#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0100 expect=skipped domain=EC
#note "H3 (ruled 2026-08-19): ECDOSE, ECDOSTXT, ECSTAT and ECOCCUR are ALL absent - the uniform all-row fire the old shape produced. The per-row rule now stays silent on this configuration (bare ECDOSE <= 0 is false on an absent column); the dataset-level fact is reported ONCE by the minted sister CDISC-CG0100-A. PLAN-retire-corpus-transforms phase 4: the rule now declares the gate variable in Requirements.Variables.All, so the absent column takes the auditable SKIP this scenario pins (Fix #330 remedy: a presence rule reports the absence once)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset EC label="Exposure as Collected"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ECSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col ECTRT type=Char label="Name of Treatment"
col ECSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Treatment"
---
